{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0349_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0349_story_04_title", "source_sha256": "835177702923a83a89439e5416dae52ce2cd17545712ef8572738dfec2ce485a", "ja": "なるの苦悩", "zh": "成海的苦恼", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0349_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0349_story_04_synopsis", "source_sha256": "168a737fa51d43b19adae231492b5022f8da02e71e44462c3e5e3d4f0bffec32", "ja": "『Astro歌謡祭』のリハーサルが終了。\nだが、なるの気持ちは乱れたまま。クロエに\n相談するが、「パフォーマンスに関係ない」\nと一蹴されてしまう。落ち込むなるに、\nクロエはなるを相棒に選んだ理由を話す。", "zh": "“Astro歌谣祭”的彩排结束。\n然而，鸣的心情依旧烦乱。她找克洛伊\n商量，却被对方以“这与演出表现无关”\n一口回绝。面对情绪低落的鸣，\n克洛伊道出了选择鸣作为搭档的理由。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0349_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0349_story_04_1000_null", "source_sha256": "abd9f29d4176cc435fd13904fc15f8a303bc1c8e56a44edd69cd0d7c5a2eaaa1", "ja": "休憩終了後……", "zh": "休息结束后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0349_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0349_story_04_1001_banngumisutaffu", "source_sha256": "7fb88c2f98ff784d34bf7d304d12ab142883839393dbd37ff650ef9be7b228b0", "ja": "みなさんのパフォーマンスが全員分終了した後、\nユーザー投票の集計中にインタビュー映像が流れます。", "zh": "所有人的表演结束后，\n在统计用户投票期间会播放采访视频。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0349_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0349_story_04_1002_banngumisutaffu", "source_sha256": "d1510a4d3d615de80282312415002ba37d3f4f361be39f9978c2af66765c15f9", "ja": "こちらは、事前に収録させていただいたものです。\nここでユーザー投票の盛り上がりを作る感じです！", "zh": "这是事先录制好的内容。\n感觉要在这里营造出用户投票的热烈氛围！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0349_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0349_story_04_1003_042miy", "source_sha256": "bacfdb2f4bc3e143779d6faadda2a8bbc5211b14ba1b008fc29fe9814513301a", "ja": "インタビュー、流れるんだ……。\nそういえば収録したっけ……。", "zh": "采访要播放出来啊……。\n说起来，我们录过来着……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0349_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0349_story_04_1004_042miy", "source_sha256": "bf790df9d23a22edc79f65043bcc5075318fef5023d11e568953c2986237b0cc", "ja": "……あ。\nこれ、真珠星ちゃんの……。", "zh": "……啊。\n这个，是真珠星同学的……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0349_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0349_story_04_1005_024ann", "source_sha256": "cadc57f85f97f1fb70681244f6d54beefb5d720d7713af965b09c7be55e00228", "ja": "「最初は、勢いっていうか。やるしかないって\n始めたところもあったんですけど……」", "zh": "“最开始……也算是一时冲动吧。虽说当时也有种\n不得不硬着头皮开始的感觉……”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0349_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0349_story_04_1006_024ann", "source_sha256": "af545cff135f9ac7a51a3b5262b8153b39fc52026b4d9e396ed46b1169bc3222", "ja": "「でも、今は……アイドル、けっこう楽しいかも？」", "zh": "「不过，现在……当偶像，可能还挺开心的？」", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0349_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0349_story_04_1007_042miy", "source_sha256": "92ee9f7a5e08ebf53a1edcec8fba534f68ef2c7ff649a99bfd830b55123b7c1b", "ja": "（……。\nなんだか、眩しい……）", "zh": "（……。\n总觉得，好耀眼……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0349_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0349_story_04_1008_042miy", "source_sha256": "972b01928afa002fd49018fcd7b8bc49099cf72d8718d9d11033d7c32997cb76", "ja": "やっと、アイドルになれたのに……\n私……全然、キラキラしてない……。", "zh": "明明好不容易才成为偶像……\n我……一点也不闪耀……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0349_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0349_story_04_1009_null", "source_sha256": "837387855f6ad61d005a5127fd8683a18579a6b552d15c1494a7fd6863205b61", "ja": "リハーサル終了後……", "zh": "彩排结束后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0349_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0349_story_04_1010_024ann", "source_sha256": "fdfd8bf161ad1882321c4a690b21c9300329083deef30abf4459d2fe9ea5870d", "ja": "あっ！　なるちゃん！", "zh": "啊！小鸣！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0349_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0349_story_04_1011_042miy", "source_sha256": "50731001cd24635cafba75f114a58fdffa23e202a4190869f81d5cf28020b852", "ja": "……。\n真珠星ちゃん……。", "zh": "……。\n真珠星……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0349_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0349_story_04_1013_minato", "source_sha256": "d9799b52e45150335482065c8158ee3c7d87abeab242b228d511e1f4e7467527", "ja": "あっ！　おーい、真珠星！", "zh": "啊！喂——，真珠星！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0349_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0349_story_04_1014_024ann", "source_sha256": "e4e18ebed1d2228b22b8c7aa350c5de904c140d9abd620c94055428cce6d19a8", "ja": "ゲッ、真田湊！\nもう！　いい加減、話しかけてこないでってば～！", "zh": "呃，真田湊！\n真是的！都说了别再来跟我搭话了啦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0349_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0349_story_04_1016_024ann", "source_sha256": "6a45592287989305b33cf85b30ebad62cf62839fbca403b20703523708448a31", "ja": "あっ！？　な、なるちゃーん！！", "zh": "啊！？成、成奈酱——！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0349_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0349_story_04_1017_null", "source_sha256": "d0d272347306d9475699dfb6b435f03bc6aaf6115eaaefbc784559d516356ae4", "ja": "帰宅途中……", "zh": "回家途中……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0349_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0349_story_04_1018_042miy", "source_sha256": "c564b63202e125813c1c31b4c4bb674e1219552c80aaba05b03706206cd0e010", "ja": "……あの、クロエさん。\n今日は、すみませんでした……。", "zh": "……那个，克洛伊小姐。\n今天真的很对不起……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0349_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0349_story_04_1019_034ayu", "source_sha256": "4c6011aab898306f041e2557f6f33dd6f07bea3d6399025819c3e73664b37cfb", "ja": "別に謝らなくていい。本番は明日だから、\nそれまでに、コンディション整えて。", "zh": "没必要道歉。正式演出是在明天，所以在那之前调整好状态。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0349_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0349_story_04_1020_042miy", "source_sha256": "f98f89ec0caf68948f63c8cc34d70d4d03bb5321332de59824dc6038776bcc09", "ja": "はい。……あの、クロエさん。\n聞きたいことがあって……。", "zh": "好的。……那个，克洛伊小姐。\n我有件事想问……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0349_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0349_story_04_1021_042miy", "source_sha256": "7ae7f0e25b149136ae533013eda5f914bd744d2faa87e94269e352fa3fab2506", "ja": "私、間違ってるかもしれないから……。\nクロエさんの意見を、聞いてみたくて……。", "zh": "我可能想错了……\n所以想听听克洛伊你的意见……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0349_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0349_story_04_1022_034ayu", "source_sha256": "f0cbf3277a82c10ead2b824ccf9130b6a8226ad5d3edb7a07e526b1451141345", "ja": "……。\n話したければ、話せば？", "zh": "……。\n想说的话，就说吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0349_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0349_story_04_1023_042miy", "source_sha256": "86e138665d142a836fbdac4838bf036c5d9b1b5f65737387ab4e22b6405ecee8", "ja": "……。最近、真珠星ちゃんと湊くんが\n仲良くしているのを見ると、不安になるんです。", "zh": "……。最近看到真珠星和凑同学\n那么要好，我就会感到不安。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0349_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0349_story_04_1024_042miy", "source_sha256": "a794e64ca81ec7a9e789f19218275fbedd6d7ed67706746eb06e1206b2865472", "ja": "なんだか、気持ちが暗い方に\n引っ張られている感じがするっていうか……。", "zh": "总觉得，心情好像被拉向了阴暗的一边……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0349_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0349_story_04_1025_034ayu", "source_sha256": "9c489c3f615ce2a108efb8a0355d09164f2ab08b4b660c31c05a2920f486e1b6", "ja": "ふーん……。\n嫉妬してるってこと？", "zh": "嗯……是在嫉妒吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0349_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0349_story_04_1026_042miy", "source_sha256": "0b6a9252b1950f32940ecafdc25f8539357543d5c97c85236fd77e240c830fd4", "ja": "そう言っていいのかどうかも、わからなくて……。\n真珠星ちゃんは、友達だし。", "zh": "我连该不该这么说都不知道……真珠星是我的朋友嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0349_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0349_story_04_1027_042miy", "source_sha256": "c907a2f902e40bb1a17e2ec9119f445e42709c0ab2e8e7d38d86179f9abc1cc8", "ja": "私と湊くんは、幼馴染みたいなものだから。\n引っかかってるのは、私だけなのかも……。", "zh": "我和湊君算是青梅竹马吧。也许在意这件事的只有我……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0349_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0349_story_04_1028_034ayu", "source_sha256": "0d4af4140260bd5171a5e7ddcd8664e9b430bca89dc7e54dbc872c53c9b798c3", "ja": "そう。それで？", "zh": "是。然后呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0349_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0349_story_04_1029_042miy", "source_sha256": "7b235e30af525ac33c2a08b53fe76358c1935dc3b91870dc5b9d7a81a71c15e7", "ja": "それでって……それだけです。", "zh": "你说“然后”……就只是这样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0349_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0349_story_04_1030_034ayu", "source_sha256": "62a405b0077d383782008665c4698481ac99a2000a4c7fbfc1d05de7d1e02c91", "ja": "ベストなパフォーマンスが出せない理由には\nならないね。", "zh": "这可不能成为无法发挥最佳表现的理由。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0349_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0349_story_04_1031_034ayu", "source_sha256": "068fc2606543741b241b5361c94c3a5611cd240b3eedbbed296833bfef275cd7", "ja": "三船がどうだろうと、\n見てる方には関係ない。", "zh": "不管三船怎么样，对观众来说都没关系。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0349_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0349_story_04_1033_042miy", "source_sha256": "db9a0d3b25c0131ff933d81d0f2cc6286d5e6bc3c2df25bfa64b532487f4bfce", "ja": "（やっぱり、クロエさんと私は違う……）", "zh": "（果然，我和克洛伊小姐是不一样的……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0349_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0349_story_04_1034_042miy", "source_sha256": "4ed92326bcc4bc2f502f6ea9eb76b07b0fa48b52b8c6db3148797eecab679f34", "ja": "（私みたいな、できない人間の気持ちは……\nクロエさんには、わからないのかも……）", "zh": "（像我这样什么都做不到的人……克洛伊小姐或许无法理解我的心情……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0349_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0349_story_04_1035_034ayu", "source_sha256": "02a9b9e50ca95397d4c6ab27907377f0a42e311d3a6d523418f89b9e2bca80fe", "ja": "あのさ。\n三船は、誰のためにアイドルやってるわけ？", "zh": "那个……我说。\n三船，你到底是为了谁才当偶像的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0349_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0349_story_04_1036_042miy", "source_sha256": "2869f5c4bed0b13b520933580e1ec0ce6e0d21786cd773e50d40a9def3381a27", "ja": "えっ？　だ、誰のため……？", "zh": "诶？为、为了谁……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0349_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0349_story_04_1037_034ayu", "source_sha256": "00700f112e56f1f0a1a83173920db6ad3f1c5253dec9114afb9aa2fda0e62098", "ja": "チーム制の『I.V.』になる直前、\n神宮寺に聞かれたことがある。", "zh": "在成为团队制的『I.V.』之前，\n神宫寺曾经问过我一件事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0349_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0349_story_04_1038_034ayu", "source_sha256": "50f2755a495adf29e9436d5ae2d9397d94c86daf1a68738d03f38bbb0952643e", "ja": "「もし相方を組むなら、真珠星となる、\nどちらがいい？」って。私は、お前を選んだ。", "zh": "“‘要是找个搭档，真珠星和成，\n你想选哪个？’……而我，选了你。”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0349_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0349_story_04_1039_042miy", "source_sha256": "1e563207a89317b6f6dd5ef622837cf6eb0e14acefa76edb4a92771b8c10a640", "ja": "えっ！？　そんなの初めて聞いて……\nというか、ど、どうして私……？", "zh": "诶！？这种事我还是第一次听说……\n话说，怎、怎么会是我……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0349_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0349_story_04_1040_034ayu", "source_sha256": "ae7e370bbdae9e65fbbb545e3229d0f985937e11290bf96323a1e7ec2247f485", "ja": "自分でアイドルになりたいって決めて、\n養成スクールに入ってきたって聞いたから。", "zh": "因为听说你是自己决定要成为偶像，才进入培训学校的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0349_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0349_story_04_1041_034ayu", "source_sha256": "e944849450904befc153684c4f334607d3565f0cd5d201e343078b8a6a6b138c", "ja": "自分のやりたい事を、自分のために選んだ。\nだから、三船を選んだ。一宮真珠星は、違ったから。", "zh": "我为自己选择了自己想做的事。所以，我选择了三船。因为一宫真珠星不一样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0349_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0349_story_04_1043_034ayu", "source_sha256": "8355dd6e8cb6e8357b59fd92b8672be49074f7415eab8ec78f9e50054dcc6a7d", "ja": "そもそも、選ばれるんじゃなくて、\n自分を選ばせるのがアイドルだし。……違う？", "zh": "说到底，偶像不是被人选中，而是要让别人选择自己。……不是吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0349_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0349_story_04_1044_034ayu", "source_sha256": "5dd4b986f231a43e632878c628b9ba22f7d7ce436d2a64649dba5a74b279a26f", "ja": "どんな手を使ってでも、\n自分を見るように仕向ける。話はそこから。", "zh": "不管用什么手段，\n都要让他们把目光投向自己。事情要从那里开始。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0349_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0349_story_04_1045_042miy", "source_sha256": "baa3a09021a866811231f7f5e7504a17499b87cf3c9662e764e5e73901795c06", "ja": "どんな手を、使ってでも……。", "zh": "无论用什么手段……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0349_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0349_story_04_1046_034ayu", "source_sha256": "97458f72b75865d14ba81235fc06df0fe425653511f47ceeeb4fb70f04cd373e", "ja": "そう。得意だろ？\n演技。", "zh": "没错。你很擅长吧？\n演戏。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
